  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;5. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;6. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;7. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;8. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;9. On December 1, 2025, Alliance Pipeline L.P. filed a rate case under Section 4 of the Natural Gas Act. A procedural schedule has been established, with an initial decision due May 26, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="f-11" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;10. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="f-12" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;11. Pursuant to note 9, on December 31, 2025, FERC issued an order accepting and suspending the filed tariff records for five months, to be effective upon motion June 1, 2026, subject to refund. Alliance's actual recourse rate revenues will be subject to the final outcome of the pending proceeding in Docket No RP26-257-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-13" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;12. Effective January 1, 2026, the following changes were made for Alliance Pipeline Inc., the general partner of Alliance Pipeline L.P.:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Director added: Andrew Schwerha&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Officers added: J. Scott Burrows as President &amp;amp; Chief Executive Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cameron J. Goldade as Chief Financial Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Christopher S. Scherman as Chief Marketing &amp;amp; Strategy Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Sarah J. Schwann as Chief Legal, People &amp;amp; Corporate Affairs Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Jaret A. Sprott as Chief Operating Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;C. Ian Balfour as Senior Vice-President, Project Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Carmen Lee-Essington as Senior Vice-President, Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Chris W. Rousch as Vice-President, Commercial &amp;amp; Customer Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Fabrizio S. Chiacchia as Vice-President, Business Development &amp;amp; New Ventures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Mike J. Koski as Vice-President, Engineering &amp;amp; Construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;George Mitsopoulos as Vice-President, Safety&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Jana Murdock as Vice-President, Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Anouska Spencer as Vice-President, Technical Services &amp;amp; Supply Chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Dan Tucunel as Vice-President, Capital Markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Sean M.A. Wilson as Vice-President, External Affairs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:108pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Scott Seibert as Vice-President&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Officer removed: Heather Christie-Burns as Chief Executive Officer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="f-14" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0f7f40;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;13. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-15" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;(thousands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;U.S.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;dollars,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;unless otherwise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;noted)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-16" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:15pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Note 1 Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:148%"&gt;The interim financial statements of Alliance Pipeline L.P. (&#8220;Alliance&#8221; or the "Partnership") have been prepared by management in accordance with accounting practices prescribed by Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&#8220;FERC&#8221;) as set forth in its Uniform System of Accounts. These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in the Form 2 of Alliance, for the year ended December 31, 2025 (&#8220;2025 Year End Filing&#8221;). These interim financial statements are unaudited, but in management's opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. Operating results for the three months ended March 31, 2026 are not necessarily indicative of results to be achieved for the full year ending December 31, 2026. Certain information and notes which would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted. All dollar amounts in the notes to the financial statements are stated in thousands of U.S. dollars, unless otherwise noted. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:148%"&gt;The notes include disclosure of any material changes from the 2025 Year End Filing and any material contingencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfRevenuesAndExpensesForTrackedCostAndSpecialSurchargeTextBlock id="f-17" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Note 2 Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#00497f;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:14pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Revenue Categories&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.553%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:62.726%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:16.986%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:16.988%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:2pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="6" style="border-top:2pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Three Months Ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;March 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#00497f;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:ce