ilizing the Reverse South Georgia flowback methodology over the remaining life of the property as of January 1, 2018, which was equal to 26.0 years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRateTreatmentForUnamortizedLossOnReacquiredDebtAndUnamortizedGainOnReacquiredDebtTextBlock>
